default.q.n3-30-q31-31.explanation:
「落ち着く」 has the following main meanings:
1. To calm down, be composed, regain one's composure (mood, emotions, attitude);
2. To settle down, stabilize (a situation, weather);
3. To settle down and establish a stable life.
Common expressions: 「落ち着いて話す/行動する」 (to speak/act calmly), 「生活が落ち着く」 (for one's life to settle down).
Example: 深呼吸をして、心を落ち着かせた。(I took deep breaths to calm myself down.)
